  "title": "json+json_3gpp: Ignore insignificant whitespace in compact mode",
  "description": "We have already tokenized the JSON when json_key_lookup is called.\n\nRather than doing offset and length calculations using strlen of the\nkey in the use_compact case, look at the appropriate token to find\nthe offset and length to use. This has the advantage of correctly\nignoring insignificant whitespace.",
